  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding of archived Alaska Medicaid Imbruvica (ibrutinib) criteria. Effective date 2022-05-01 retained from source metadata; PDF Version 1 footer Original 11/14/2014; Approval 11/21/2014.",
    "Encoded: three mutually indication-gated approval branches, pregnancy denial and renewal/reauthorization denial for more than three therapy interruptions due to adverse reactions/toxicities. The chronic_lymphocytic_leukemia indication means CLL without 17p deletion. Authorization context is required to apply the renewal denial.",
    "Cautions (notes only): avoid strong CYP3A inhibitors and inducers. If concomitant moderate CYP3A inhibitor use is necessary, refer to the package insert for Imbruvica dose reduction guidance.",
    "Duration (notes only): approval may be granted up to 1 year.",
    "Quantity (notes only): MCL four 140 mg capsules (560 mg) per day; CLL three 140 mg capsules (420 mg) per day. max_units is null.",
    "Diagnosis and prior therapy are attestations; documentation verification, interaction management, dose reduction, duration and quantity enforcement require manual review. PDL status unknown; no linked alternatives."
